To fully implement this library with all the specified features (e.g., integration with an external data ingestion service, health monitoring, batch processing, etc.), you would need to expand on these basic functions and add additional components, such as error handling, retry logic, anomaly detection, alerting systems, and more. Each component would require detailed implementation considering performance, reliability, and maintainability trade-offs.']

