This code is intended as a starting point and does not include advanced features such as data partitioning, compression, tiered storage solutions, asynchronous data processing pipelines, adaptive backoff strategies, circuit breakers, retry logic, horizontal scaling, schema evolution handling, security measures, robust logging and monitoring capabilities, network failure recovery mechanisms, performance profiling, benchmarking, caching strategies, edge case handling, or comprehensive testing strategies. These features are crucial for a production-ready HFT market data management library and should be implemented as needed based on the specific requirements and constraints of the system.']

